dsh-usage-limits launchpad-status: show plugin status contributions on the Launchpad.

dsh-TUI 0.14.0 renders `ctx.tuiStatus` text entries and rich views (registerView) only in
Chat, above the prompt. The Launchpad (first screen) is a separate component and showed
none, so a status line appeared only after the first prompt. Chat now passes its status
entries, views, the pointer-only view kit and the view error reporter to the Launchpad,
which renders them the same way (rich views inside PluginStatusViewBoundary, then the
joined dim text) in one full-width, centred block above the input card.

Applies after the other pkgs/dsh-tui.nix patches and before dsh-speed's postPatch script.

